FuchsiaCity_House2_Text_Herbalist::
    .string "I gather herbs in FUCHSIA FOREST.\p"
    .string "My bitter medicines heal, but can\n"
    .string "make POKéMON less fond of you.\p"
    .string "What can I prepare for you?$"

FuchsiaCity_House2_Text_Farewell::
